[Desktop Entry]
Name=系统出厂自愈与还原
Name[en_US]=System Reset & Recovery
Comment=一键重置桌面设置、输入法环境或彻底出厂还原
Comment[en_US]=Restore desktop, input methods, and extensions to factory defaults
Exec=wezterm start -- ujust reset-system
Icon=system-software-update
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=System;Settings;Utility;
Keywords=reset;factory;restore;recovery;还原;重置;自愈;
